\u00c4ngstigende Inhalte","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"21 May, 2024"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cThey continue to push the boundaries of what games can achieve, bringing classic literature to life in a fresh and exciting way.\u201d<br>Adventure Gamers<br><br>\u201cThe weight of words in each sentence from Playing Kafka has intense, unforgettable emotional impact.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Indian<br><br>\u201cAs somebody who is no stranger to Kafka\u2019s work, I have to say one thing to developers: good job.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Vortex<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911850/ss_3e4b0c76bc50cace16cc81d39d9112f1fd776743.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734535695","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911850/ss_3e4b0c76bc50cace16cc81d39d9112f1fd776743.600x338.jpg?t=1734535695"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911850/ss_6af6981bd9ac6e72a3ea3c5c4a843bb99325681b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734535695","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911850/ss_6af6981bd9ac6e72a3ea3c5c4a843bb99325681b.600x338.jpg?t=1734535695"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911850/ss_93a45ff8a038fb6fd397d4285fc33fcf288a14b8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734535695","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911850/ss_93a45ff8a038fb6fd397d4285fc33fcf288a14b8.600x338.jpg?t=1734535695"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911850/ss_7558612c692b9a057abfb2c38d9ee5b15d9e7226.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734535695","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911850/ss_7558612c692b9a057abfb2c38d9ee5b15d9e7226.600x338.jpg?t=1734535695"},{"id":4,"path_ful