re are things that often fail on nothing but themselves. Is there even a way out? Playing Kafka is a narrative adventure full of impenetrable schemes, insidious plot twists and conversations that slip out of hand. Based on Kafka\u2019s life and his work, developed with Kafka experts.","steam_appid":2911850,"support_info":{"email":"info@charlesgames.net","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://charlesgames.net/playing-kafka-en/"}